{% comment %}
  TapFive Review — "The Solution" section.
  1) Upload the bar photo to Settings → Files as: solution-bar-scene.png
  2) Add via: Customize → Add section → Custom Liquid → paste.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="tfr-solution" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="tfr-solution__inner">

    <div class="tfr-solution__left">
      <p class="tfr-solution__eyebrow">The solution</p>
      <h2 class="tfr-solution__h2">Tap. Review. Done. <span class="tfr-gold">It's really that simple.</span></h2>
      <p class="tfr-solution__lead">No tech skills. No learning curve. No staff training. The stand removes every step between a happy customer and a posted 5-star review.</p>

      <div class="tfr-solution__steps">

        <div class="tfr-solution__step">
          <span class="tfr-solution__icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"/><path d="M3.3 7 12 12l8.7-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <div class="tfr-solution__stephead"><span class="tfr-solution__num">01</span><h3>Unbox &amp; place</h3></div>
            <p>Set the stand on your counter, front desk, or table. Setup takes 30 seconds — scan the QR, paste your Google review link once, done.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tfr-solution__step">
          <span class="tfr-solution__icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v4"/><path d="M12 18v4"/><path d="M8.5 8.5a5 5 0 0 1 7 7"/><path d="M5.6 5.6a10 10 0 0 1 12.8 12.8"/><rect x="10" y="10" width="4" height="4" rx="1"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <div class="tfr-solution__stephead"><span class="tfr-solution__num">02</span><h3>Customer taps or scans</h3></div>
            <p>One tap with any smartphone — just like tap-to-pay — or a quick QR scan. No app downloads, no typing, no searching for your business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tfr-solution__step">
          <span class="tfr-solution__icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <div class="tfr-solution__stephead"><span class="tfr-solution__num">03</span><h3>Reviews roll in 24/7</h3></div>
            <p>Your Google review page opens instantly while the experience is fresh. Ratings climb, rankings rise, and new customers find you first.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tfr-solution__media">
      <img
        src="{{ 'solution-bar-scene.png' | file_url }}"
        alt="Customer holding a phone with the Google review page open next to the NFC review stand on a bar counter"
        loading="lazy"
      >
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .tfr-solution{ background:#0A0B0E; padding:96px 24px; }
  .tfr-solution__inner{ max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:4rem; align-items:center; }
  @media (min-width:990px){ .tfr-solution__inner{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }

  .tfr-solution__eyebrow{ font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:.25em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#D4AF37; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 1rem; }
  .tfr-solution__h2{ font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif; font-weight:700; line-height:1.12; color:#F8F9FA; font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem); letter-spacing:-.01em; margin:0 0 1.25rem; }
  .tfr-gold{ background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F3E5AB 0%,#D4AF37 55%,#E6C200 100%); -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; color:transparent; }
  .tfr-solution__lead{ color:#94A3B8; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.7; max-width:34rem; margin:0 0 3rem; }

  .tfr-solution__steps{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1rem; }
  .tfr-solution__step{ display:flex; gap:1.25rem; align-items:flex-start; background:rgba(18,20,28,.8); border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.15); border-radius:1.5rem; padding:1.5rem; box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.5); transition:transform .2s ease, border-color .2s ease; }
  .tfr-solution__step:hover{ transform:translateY(-4px); border-color:rgba(212,175,55,.4); }
  .tfr-solution__icon{ flex-shrink:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:3rem; height:3rem; border-radius:1rem; color:#0A0B0E; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F3E5AB 0%,#D4AF37 50%,#996515 100%); box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(212,175,55,.35); }
  .tfr-solution__stephead{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.75rem; margin-bottom:.4rem; }
  .tfr-solution__num{ font-size:.72rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.2em; color:rgba(212,175,55,.6); }
  .tfr-solution__step h3{ font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif; font-weight:700; font-size:1.15rem; color:#F8F9FA; letter-spacing:-.01em; margin:0; }
  .tfr-solution__step p{ color:#94A3B8; font-size:.875rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0; }

  .tfr-solution__media{ border-radius:2rem; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.25); box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.6); }
  .tfr-solution__media img{ display:block; width:100%; height:100%; max-height:75vh; object-fit:cover; }
</style>
